Package: ai.operit
Name: Operit2 (device automation, rootless)
Version: 0.3.51
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Operit2 (iOS, rootless) — a personal/AI-experimental fork adapted from AAswordman/Operit2, with the Operit2 Flutter UI bundled in. Screenshot, OCR, touch/input and device automation are delegated to the ios-mcp backend running on the device.
 .
 This package is NOT an official release. It is an unofficial, personal + AI
 experimental adaptation of the original Operit2 project. See:
  - This project: https://github.com/ddddddedcds/Operit2
  - Original work: https://github.com/AAswordman/Operit2
  - Original predecessor / idea source: https://github.com/AAswordman/Operit
 .
 Third-party open-source packages used by this build (none omitted); source
 links below:
  - ElleKit — rootless tweak injection libraries & loader (by opa334)
    https://github.com/opa334/ElleKit
  - ios-mcp — MCP server for AI-driven iOS device control (by witchan)
    https://github.com/witchan/ios-mcp
 .
 Acknowledgements (感谢):
  Special thanks to opa334 for ElleKit, the rootless hooking substrate that
  makes this tweak possible; to witchan for ios-mcp, whose device-control MCP
  server powers Operit2's screenshot/OCR/automation layer; and to AAswordman
  for the original Operit2 (https://github.com/AAswordman/Operit2) and the
  earlier Operit project (https://github.com/AAswordman/Operit) that provided
  the development ideas. Operit2 would not exist without these excellent
  open-source works.
 .
